{
  "_doc": "Voice library spec. `voices` maps a role to a Gemini TTS prebuilt voice + default delivery style (English, never read aloud). `groups` expand to clips: an array gives ids <group>_<start+i>, an object gives explicit ids. Clips for specials, worlds, bosses, fighters and weapons are added automatically from content/*. Run: npm run voice  (see content/README.md). Each voice has its own model so every role stays consistent and uses a separate free-tier quota (the free tier allows ~10 requests per model per day).",
